   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED Black-and-White Editorial v1. For Op Kit / Brand System editorial register. Adobe Monochrome profile, B&amp;W mix tuned for skin glow (orange +30 / yellow +20) and sky drama (blue -20 / aqua -10), strong S-curve contrast (darks -10 / highlights -15), intentional film grain (amount 25 / size 30). Use selectively on Brand System tier work or editorial standalone frames.</rdf:li>
